== Walkthrough ==

'''Ssynthi may be found at -55, +385, in the graveyard behind the mausoleum.  He is on Temple of Solusek Ro faction.'''

You say, 'Hail Ssynthi.'

: Ssynthi says, 'I am Ssynthi, [Warder of Ro]. Would you do a simple [service] for me?'

You say, 'A Warder of Ro?'

: Ssynthi says, 'I have renounced by ties to the shadowed men and become a follower of the one true flame, Solusek Ro. I have hopes that one day my brethren will see the errors of their ways and cease their mindless war.'

You say, 'What service can I do for you?'

: Ssynthi says, 'The body of my true love lies within this tomb. I seek a token to remember her by - the flower which lies atop her coffin. I would get it myself, but the tomb is warded against my kind. Since I can not enter, I ask you to fetch it for me.'

The Flower is a ground spawn that looks like a bag atop a coffin inside the tomb in front of Ssynthi, at loc -25, 375, -225. Its respawn time is 1 minute. Take care to not step to either side of the coffin, where there are pit traps that will drop you into the basement of Mistmoore. 

Give the flower to Ssynthi.

: Ssynthi says, 'Thank you. Since you have done me a service with no thought of reward, I offer you this small token of my favor.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Temple Of Sol Ro|Temple of Solusek Ro]] has been adjusted by 1.
* Your faction standing with [[Shadowed Men]] has been adjusted by -1.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

You receive a Scepter. (Identifies as The Scepter of Sorrow)

Notes: Ssynthi is on [[Temple Of Sol Ro]] faction, so he can be used to test your faction if you are doing the quest to raise it.<br>

== Faction Gain ==

22 turn ins (could have been 20, the counting was not especially accurate) took me from Amiable to Kindly, which would make the faction from this quest around, or just under +20 per turn in.
<br>
25 turn ins to get through amiably (came for amiably, stayed for kindly) - blue, 10/21/23
